  "content": "<div><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">生物血量條模組</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組會在生物上方添加血量條。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>提供 <strong>13 種可調整位置的血量條樣式</strong>。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按下<strong>「H 鍵」</strong>可開啟樣式選擇器。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其他可調整的血量條選項包括：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>渲染距離</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>縮放</strong>大小</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>名稱顯示</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>生命值顯示</strong>（若所選樣式支援顯示生命值）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-設定血量條<strong>僅在生物處於攻擊狀態、受傷時或滑鼠懸停時顯示</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-顯示材質可見性</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-僅顯示受傷生物</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-在設定中<strong>加入黑名單的生物</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>-若使用 Forge：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（在 <strong>blacklist = 之後輸入 minecraft:cow,minecraft:pig</strong>，以此類推即可將這些生物加入黑名單）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>-若使用 Fabric：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（在 <strong>blacklist = 之後輸入 cow,pig</strong>，以此類推即可將這些生物加入黑名單）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">希望您喜歡這個模組。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若發現任何錯誤，請告訴我。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感謝下載此模組！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sR2IOE0VgXU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
